{"step_index":1687,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-06-29T13:57:58Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough of the visual overhaul changes completed for the Nexus application including design system integrations, sidebar restyling, dashboard layout, active interventions overhaul, today's focus views, goal creation step flows, agent feed monitors, and the Tailwind import fix.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# NEXUS Visual Overhaul Walkthrough\n\nWe have completed the premium visual overhaul across the entire NEXUS application interface.\n\n## Key Accomplishments\n\n### 1. Styles & CSS Restructure (`globals.css`)\n- Restored the Tailwind directive `@import \"tailwindcss\";` at the top of the file to fix the broken layout caused by missing compile instructions.\n- Implemented the dark-theme design system colors, glassmorphic cards (`.glass`), elevated active cards (`.card`), ambient pulse dots, custom styling for input boxes, range sliders, scrollbars, and shimmers.\n\n### 2. Desktop Navigation Layout (`layout.tsx`)\n- Restyled the fixed sidebar container to use the premium `var(--bg-surface)` glass base, proper borders, and nav spacing.\n- Segmented items under navigation groups: `WORKSPACE`, `EXECUTION`, and `ANALYTICS`.\n- Integrated a live tech core badge displaying the current LLM orchestration model (Gemini 2.0 Flash) and user row avatar with quick sign-out triggers.\n\n### 3. Dashboard Interface (`dashboard/page.tsx`)\n- Overhauled page headers with dynamic greetings.\n- Revamped the health score chart with a glowing circular SVG ring, green/amber/red execution delta indicators, and animated path percentages.\n- Restyled alerts, week metrics, deadlocks, and goal grid lists with colored badges matching AT RISK, ON TRACK, and CRITICAL thresholds.\n\n### 4. Active Interventions & History (`interventions/page.tsx`)\n- Customized critical alerts with red highlights and pulse glows.\n- Re-styled layout columns, risk factors, lightbulb recommendation indicators, and accepting/dismissing rescue plan buttons.\n- Styled the historical interventions collapsible history tracker with clean, alternate badge elements.\n\n### 5. Goal Creation Form (`goals/new/page.tsx` & `syllabus-upload.tsx`)\n- Center-aligned the step container (max-width `520px`) with custom step indicator pills.\n- Redesigned the file upload dropzone to use the dark-theme elevates, dashed borders, camera trigger options, and auto-generated learning metrics previews.\n\n### 6. Focus Study Blocks (`goals/[id]/focus/page.tsx`)\n- Styled large sequence step numbers, time metadata, done/skip primary action options, and progress tracking bars using gradient colors.\n\n### 7. Agent Feed Terminal (`goals/[id]/agents/page.tsx`)\n- Converted feed items to a mission-control scanline terminal view with vertical color bars reflecting each agent type (Ingestion, Decomposition, Scheduling, Failure Prediction, etc.) and monospace activity logs.\n","Description":"Generating the walkthrough.md artifact summarizing all changes and fixes.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\U\\.gemini\\antigravity-ide\\brain\\6033b79e-7444-4620-801b-1cd96104ff5d\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing visual overhaul walkthrough file","toolSummary":"Walkthrough generation"}}]}
