{"step_index":1689,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-06-29T13:58:04Z","content":"I have successfully resolved the layout issue and finished the visual overhaul!\n\n### What Went Wrong & How It Was Fixed\nThe broken UI occurred because the Tailwind CSS directive (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`) was missing from the top of the newly updated [globals.css](file:///c:/Users/U/OneDrive/Laksh-Projects/Nexus/app/globals.css) file. In Tailwind v4, this import is required to compile and inject utility styles. \n\nI added the directive at the top of the file, and Next.js successfully recompiled the app (`npx next build` now compiles with zero errors). All components, alignments, grids, and typography now render as intended.\n\n### Summary of Revamped Screens\n* **Step 1 & 8 (Design System & Fonts):** [globals.css](file:///c:/Users/U/OneDrive/Laksh-Projects/Nexus/app/globals.css) and [layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/U/OneDrive/Laksh-Projects/Nexus/app/layout.tsx) now use Google Fonts (Inter & JetBrains Mono), custom scrollbars, glowing cards, input focuses, and glassmorphism.\n* **Step 2 (Sidebar Layout):** Left vertical navigation organized into segmented groups (`Workspace`, `Execution`, `Analytics`) with a System Core Tech Badge and quick user actions.\n* **Step 3 (Dashboard):** Custom greetings, SVG progress rings for execution health, quick stats, and grid cards for goals displaying status badges.\n* **Step 4 (Interventions):** Red-highlighted critical alert widgets, recommendation panels, and collapsible history logs at the bottom.\n* **Step 5 (Focus Study Cards):** Clear, sequential numbering system, clock indicators, skip links, and a gradient tasks progress bar.\n* **Step 6 (Goal Creation & File Upload):** A center-aligned step form with indicator dots and a dashed file upload zone that reacts to drag-and-drop.\n* **Step 7 (Agent Feed):** A dark mission-control terminal background displaying monospace activity feeds alongside colored left-hand indicator bars mapped to each specialized agent.\n\nPlease check the application now at `http://localhost:3000/dashboard` to see the new design system!"}
